Instructions for testing the Polymorphous:

1) Make sure that you update your path so that it does point to where you have installed your mlir-affine-validator:
> export PATH=(PATH to the bin):$PATH

2) Go inside any folder that you wish to test
> cd run-lu

3) run the following command to check the correctness of the code:
> make clean debug

4) run the following command to check the performance of your optimization:
> make clean profile

